    // game rolls one, and -1 gives 1 % (what the toolkit's spawner left items with); vehicles with Car_spawn_at (fuel and
    // condition full); NPCs with Spawn_NPC at the nearest spawn point, then moved to the place asked.
    // window.MDZAdmin is the API (also the toolkit's: it calls MDZAdmin.isAdmin / action), window.MDZToolkitAccess says who
    // may open the toolkit in a session; the panel is drawn into the toolkit's admin tab when it is there, else in a
    // window of its own (MDZAdmin.open(); the players panel's "Admin" button, patch 77).
