    // ---- round 14 (user 2026-10-10: "single player and multiplayer have a connection, SP stuff gets into MP and vice versa -
    // must be separate"). Measured (sepprobe): a client's own save was already apart (patch 48: "mp_mysave"), but a host's
    // session saved into the single player's "mysave" - other players' drops, the session's seed and opened list ended up in
    // the host's single-player world, and that world was the server's. Now a host's session world is the C2 save slot
    // "mp_hostsave" ($mp_host_slot = 1 while hosting: the game's SaveState / LoadState pick it, patch 93); single player keeps
